          "width": 710,
          "height": 80,
          "visible": true,
          "text": "• Developed deep reinforcement learning agents for high-frequency algorithmic trade routing.\n• Built end-to-end continuous learning pipelines processing 80TB of telemetry data weekly.\n• Published first-author paper at ICML 2017 on sample-efficient policy gradients.",
