          "text": "• Spearheaded sparse mixture-of-experts (MoE) routing research, publishing spotlight paper at NeurIPS 2020.\n• Deployed distributed FP8/INT4 post-training quantization routines in vLLM, compressing model size by 65% with <0.3% perplexity degradation.\n• Collaborated with hardware vendors to benchmark model execution on custom TPU and GPU accelerators.\n• Mentored 6 doctoral research interns into full-time research positions.",
