          "visible": true,
          "text": "• Lead 64-person marketing organization spanning Brand, Performance, Product Marketing, Lifecycle CRM, and PR.\n• Re-architected full-funnel acquisition strategy, driving 142% YoY growth in inbound enterprise qualified leads (SQLs).\n• Spearheaded viral freemium onboarding loops, increasing free-to-paid conversion from 3.1% to 6.8% ($26M new ARR).\n• Directed $22M annual paid performance media budget across Google, Meta, LinkedIn, and YouTube at 3.8x blended ROAS.",
