          "width": 1040,
          "height": 110,
          "visible": true,
          "text": "• Direct enterprise PMO organization comprising 18 senior project and program managers overseeing a portfolio of 34 concurrent initiatives.\n• Governed $42M multi-year cloud replatforming migrating 180 on-premise application workloads to AWS, finishing 6 weeks ahead of schedule.\n• Designed and instituted standardized PMO intake gates, risk scoring matrices, and financial burn models, decreasing project slippage from 22% to 4%.\n• Negotiated enterprise master services agreements with 8 global IT vendors, yielding $6.4M in annualized software licensing and labor efficiencies.\n• Reported monthly project portfolio status, health metrics, and contingency forecasts directly to Executive Committee and Chief Information Officer.",
