          "width": 1040,
          "height": 110,
          "visible": true,
          "text": "• Orchestrated $28M core digital banking overhaul across 6 agile release trains (ARTs) involving 120 developers, architects, and QA engineers.\n• Transitioned waterfall release process to 2-week continuous delivery sprints, elevating release velocity by 300% with zero downtime cutover.\n• Managed compliance and regulatory audits with OCC and Federal Reserve examiners, obtaining clean sign-off across all consumer privacy requirements.\n• Supervised third-party systems integration with Fiserv core and payment rails, facilitating 4.5M monthly real-time financial transactions.\n• Awarded Apex Leadership Excellence Award in 2019 for successfully executing high-risk database migration with 0% data discrepancy.",
