          "visible": true,
          "text": "• Oversaw editorial visual strategy across 10 annual print issues, reaching monthly global readership of 4.2M high-net-worth subscribers.\n• Redesigned publication typographic system with custom display serifs, increasing reader engagement time by 28%.\n• Produced and art-directed 45 on-location cover shoots across 12 countries with international supermodels and visionary photographers.\n• Directed digital cover animations and interactive mobile editions receiving Webby Award for Best Visual Design in Media.",
