          "text": "• Architect multi-tenant AWS serverless and containerized architecture supporting 40M+ monthly active requests.\n• Led 14 engineers across backend, DevOps, and frontend squads executing zero-downtime microservices decomposition.\n• Re-architected data ingestion pipeline with AWS Kinesis, EventBridge, and DynamoDB, cutting P99 latency by 65ms.\n• Implemented automated FinOps tagging and spot-instance node groups, reducing annualized AWS bill by $1.2M (41% savings).",
