          "text": "• Built responsive web user interfaces in React and TypeScript integrated with high-throughput Go backend services.\n• Designed GraphQL schema unifying 8 distinct backend REST services into a singular strongly-typed client API gateway.\n• Containerized developer local environments using Docker Compose, decreasing onboarding setup time from 3 days to 45 minutes.",
