          "visible": true,
          "id": "rep-706-s2-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "x": 180,
          "y": 300,
          "width": 840,
          "height": 340,
          "text": "In a year characterized by macro-economic adjustments across global luxury retail, our Maison adhered strictly to volume discipline. We consciously chose not to inflate production quotas to meet synthetic demand surges, prioritizing the preservation of secondary market valuations and exclusivity for our collectors.\n\nEvery mechanical caliber leaving our Vallée de Joux manufacture was fully assembled, decorated, and adjusted by a single master watchmaker, fulfilling the rigorous strictures of the Poinçon de Genève.",
